  "minimal_implementation": [
    "Add an independent default-describe CLI accepting an immutable manifest of original summary/trace files and hashes; never instantiate OrderObserver or fault runners.",
    "Derive operation kind/key from each preserved state.pending entry; validate keys, phase, known order ID and matching original trace. Distinguish unsent cancel from unknown sent operations.",
    "Explicit --run performs at most one GET /receipts/{original_key} per manifest entry through VersionedClient, follow_redirects=False and trust_env=False; no retries, no POST or resource action.",
    "Reuse validate_committed_receipt with expected operation kind/order ID, also bind original create key, item and quantity when available. Create commit confirms only the create stage; only a valid cancelled snapshot confirms a terminal cancel stage.",
    "Write a new exclusive output only; preserve original summaries/traces and verify hashes afterwards. Report 404, invalid JSON/version/receipt, timeout and transport failure as unresolved rather than non-execution.",
    "Include a sanitized fixture/example manifest and teammate instructions; private original keys stay in original local evidence or a private manifest, not the public observation. Offline MockTransport tests prove GET-only/bounds, identity/snapshot/content rejection and no input rewrites."
  ],
